# Benchmark run artifacts.
#
# `results/` holds three kinds of output:
#   * results/cache/       -- LLM response + daily-budget cache (regenerated; huge)
#   * results/<suite>/...  -- summary.json / predictions.jsonl / raw.log per run
#   * harness/datasets/data/-- third-party datasets (downloaded; some large)
#
# Real result JSON is committed deliberately by the CI `benchmarks` workflow
# (small, curated) -- not swept in by a local `git add benchmarks/`. Everything
# below is local-only.

results/
harness/datasets/data/
!harness/datasets/data/.gitkeep

# local env
.env
*.pyc
__pycache__/
